  m_text: 'In days long since past...

    The Kingdom of Mycelia, ruled by none...

    Was
    threatened once again...

    The Agarics...

    Vicious, hungry for power,
    prowled the forest...

    Stopping at nothing to achieve their ambitions...

    Mycelia
    would belong to them indeed...

    The Edge of The Forest was first to fall...

    The
    Goldcaps a much peaceful tribe who made the forest their home...

    Soon met
    their inevitable demise...



'
